# GO-2026-5932 covers the golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp packages. Its fix moves
# them into their own module at golang.org/x/crypto
# 0.58.1-0.20261009181718-2f1f834330b2, which no tagged release contains yet,
# so every golang.org/x/crypto release up to v0.58.0 matches it. The provider
# builds no openpgp package: `go list -deps ./... | grep x/crypto/openpgp` is
# empty, and govulncheck, which checks reachability, does not report it.
# The exp date matches the ignoreUntil in osv-scanner.toml: re-check this entry
# once a tagged x/crypto release with the fix is out.
GO-2026-5932 exp:2027-02-01
